{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1490","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Sum of Cubes"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a positive integer $$$x$$$. Check whether the number $$$x$$$ is representable as the sum of the cubes of two positive integers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Formally, you need to check if there are two integers $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ ($$$1 \\le a, b$$$) such that $$$a^3+b^3=x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, if $$$x = 35$$$, then the numbers $$$a=2$$$ and $$$b=3$$$ are suitable ($$$2^3+3^3=8+27=35$$$). If $$$x=4$$$, then no pair of numbers $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ is suitable."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 100$$$) — the number of test cases. Then $$$t$$$ test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test case contains one integer $$$x$$$ ($$$1 \\le x \\le 10^{12}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please note, that the input for some test cases won't fit into $$$32$$$-bit integer type, so you should use at least $$$64$$$-bit integer type in your programming language."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output on a separate line: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if $$$x$$$ is representable as the sum of the cubes of two positive integers. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" in any case (for example, the strings "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" will be recognized as positive)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n1\n2\n4\n34\n35\n16\n703657519796\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nNO\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The number $$$1$$$ is not representable as the sum of two cubes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The number $$$2$$$ is represented as $$$1^3+1^3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The number $$$4$$$ is not representable as the sum of two cubes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The number $$$34$$$ is not representable as the sum of two cubes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The number $$$35$$$ is represented as $$$2^3+3^3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The number $$$16$$$ is represented as $$$2^3+2^3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The number $$$703657519796$$$ is represented as $$$5779^3+7993^3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1490C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1490/problem/C"}